# Kismet affects each opponent in a multiplayer game (CR 614.1d).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Kismet
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kismet.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
